        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_bulldog.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 387e009e-fe73-4b96-bcde-997b8a6dcceb).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47,\r\rToday i need you to take out members of a secret cult called &apos;Noah&apos;s Ark&apos;. They are trying to take out the ICA, and have been for sometime. We just got confirmation that their leader sent some of his members to Dartmoor to look for any ICA agents. Dispose of some of their members to send a little message to their leader.\r\rGood luck 47.",
